koinv-hwcaps-ifunc (1.0-1~koinv1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of IFUNC resolvers for RVV 1.0 vectorized routines
  * Provides IFUNC resolvers for memcpy, memset, memcmp, strlen, strcmp
  * Resolvers query hwprobe syscall for RVA23U64 support
  * Part of KoinV hwcaps infrastructure

